  WrittenDialogue: "Oh hello, Ari. Did you see they might make a new Jak and Daxter?\nHave we ever talked about that before?\nUm no, but it’s big news.\nTo who?\nUh, {1}how are you doing at puzzles by the way?\nWell I’ve been winning so far.\nYeah I’m getting really good too, I bet you’re impressed.\nI mean it’s okay.\nDid I mention I think you’re cute?\nMaybe you shouldn’t mention that.\nYou’re so humble, that’s why I love you.\nThat’s great but I’m gay so I can never love you back, sorry.\nWhat??\nDo you even know what that is?\nOf course, the football team would call me that everyday.\nReally shouldn’t be used as an insult like that but-\nIt’s just my luck! The last girl in town I had a chance with and she’s gay!\nIf it makes you feel any better, if I was straight I still definitely wouldn’t date you.\nHow can I feel better when I’m in perpetual loneliness?\nI know how ya feel but the most I could really do is.. {0.7}Be your friend.\nA girl? Who’s a friend?\nUh yeah technically.\nThat sounds pretty good. Thanks!\nYeah like whatever.\nAs friends would you like to practice a round of puzzles with me?\nSure I can do that.\nBut just cause we’re friends, don’t think I’ll go easy on you!{1}\nThat was a really weird cadence for that."
  DialogueCharacterNames: "JEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI\nJEFFERY\nARI"
